   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Liquid Fill\n\nA drop falls into an outlined mark and liquid rises with a sloshing surface and bubbles until the mark is solid. Give it any closed shape as the shape path variable.\n\nCategory: logo-stings. Length: 2.6 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A beverage, fintech or utility brand wants a reveal about filling up, loading or topping off.\n- Your mark is a simple closed shape you can express as one SVG path, and the sting should fill it.\n\nAvoid when:\n- Your logo is a detailed image rather than a single closed shape: wrap it with spotlight or orbit-lock.\n- The mark should feel bouncy and soft rather than fluid: use inflate.\n\nVariables:\n- text (string): Wordmark, default \"studio\"\n- shape (string): Shape path, default \"M 27 2 H 73 A 25 25 0 0 1 98 27 V 73 A 25 25 0 0 1 73 98 H 27 A 25 25 0 0 1 2 73 V 27 A 25 25 0 0 1 27 2 Z\"\n- background_color (color): Background, default \"#111111\"\n- liquid_color (color): Liquid, default \"#E5322D\"\n- outline_color (color): Outline, default \"#FFFFFF\"\n- bubble_color (color): Bubbles, default \"#FFFFFF\"\n- speed (number, 0.25-3): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
